WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.111
Unit nineteen. Tech Time Limits!

2
00:00:05.035 --> 00:00:09.873
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:13.523
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:17.387
Today we learn about Tech Time Limits. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:22.397
Time limit. Say it with me. Time limit!

6
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:30.133
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

7
00:00:33.619 --> 00:00:37.186
Break. Say it with me. Break!

8
00:00:40.664 --> 00:00:44.531
Timer. Say it with me. Timer!

9
00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:52.386
Healthy habit. Say it with me. Healthy habit!

10
00:00:55.883 --> 00:01:00.747
Outdoor time. Say it with me. Outdoor time!

11
00:01:04.226 --> 00:01:08.160
Schedule. Say it with me. Schedule!

12
00:01:11.679 --> 00:01:15.662
Reminder. Say it with me. Reminder!

13
00:01:19.163 --> 00:01:27.834
A tech time limit helps me balance screen time with other activities. I use a timer as a reminder to take a break and go outside.

14
00:01:27.884 --> 00:01:31.442
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.442 --> 00:01:37.954
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:39.154
Break!

17
00:01:40.078 --> 00:01:45.435
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.485 --> 00:01:46.635
Schedule!

19
00:01:47.598 --> 00:01:55.502
Did you know? Many devices now have a built-in timer feature to help remind you when it's time for a break!

20
00:01:55.552 --> 00:01:58.007
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:09.166
Think and answer. What is a healthy activity you enjoy besides using a screen?

22
00:02:09.216 --> 00:02:10.484
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.376 --> 00:02:17.187
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:20.366
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

